  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "おおくの　ぶくんを　たてた　せんしのよろいによって　しんかした　すがた。！\u0003\u0007忠誠心ちゅうせいしん忠誠心の　あつい　ポケモン。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "많은 무공을 세운 전사의 갑옷에 의해 진화한 모습. 충성심이 강한 포켓몬이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "藉由立下眾多勛績的戰士所穿的鎧甲進化成的樣子。是忠心耿耿的寶可夢。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il a évolué grâce à l’armure d’une illustre âme guerrière. Ce Pokémon est extrêmement loyal.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es entwickelte sich durch die Rüstung eines heldenhaften Kriegers zu dieser Form. Crimanzo besitzt einen ausgeprägten Sinn für Loyalität.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Evolucionó al portar la armadura de un guerrero de renombre. Este Pokémon destaca por su gran lealtad.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si è evoluto in questa forma grazie all’armatura di un guerriero distintosi sul campo di battaglia. È noto per la sua estrema fedeltà.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Armarouge evolved through the use of a set of armor that belonged to a distinguished warrior. This Pokémon is incredibly loyal.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "多くの　武勲を　立てた　戦士の鎧によって　進化した　姿。！\u0003\u0007忠誠心ちゅうせいしん忠誠心の　厚い　ポケモン。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "借助立下诸多功勋的战士所穿的铠甲进化而来的样子。是忠心耿耿的宝可梦。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Evolucionó al portar la armadura de un guerrero de renombre. Este Pokémon destaca por su gran lealtad.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "エスパーと　ほのおの　エネルギーできょうかされた　よろいを　まとう。しゃくねつの　ひのたまを　はなつ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "에스퍼와 불꽃의 에너지로 강화된 갑옷을 두르고 있다. 작열하는 불덩이를 발사한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "身上包裹著受到超能力和火焰能量強化的鎧甲。會釋放熾熱的火球。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon porte une armure renforcée par de l’énergie de type Psy et de type Feu. Il lance des boules de feu à très haute température.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es trägt eine Rüstung, die mit Psycho- sowie Feuer-Energie verstärkt wurde, und verschießt glühend heiße Feuerbälle.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Porta una armadura reforzada con energía psíquica e ígnea. Ataca lanzando bolas de fuego incandescentes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Questo Pokémon indossa un’armatura rinforzata dall’energia Psico e Fuoco. Lancia palle di fuoco incandescenti contro i suoi nemici.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
